{"id":"wb-7-1703","name":"东吴大学旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东吴大学旧址","text":"东吴大学旧址位于江苏省苏州市姑苏区，今天苏州大学本部的南半部分。是原东吴大学所在，旧址占地面积约6万平方米，总建筑面积约2.1万平方米。总体采取西式建筑布局，局部点缀中式园林。至今仍留有14幢自1910年代陆续建造的校舍。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%90%B4%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84957777,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84957777","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c4d58087d87a550aafadcf23.jpg","title":"SuDa_clock_building.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SuDa_clock_building.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/SuDa_clock_building.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Harro5","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Clock building on the campus of Soochow University, Suzhou, Jiangsu, PRC.","width":320,"height":240}}